        <mxCell id="p3-c40" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;State (LifecycleState)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;use_case, release, gate, gate_status (cache), rework_count, branch, pr, flow_version, budget_used&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every resume starts with sync: the engine decides, the event only wakes the thread&lt;br&gt;• Nodes are idempotent; a thread can be restarted from engine state after a flow upgrade&lt;br&gt;• Worker output is commits + PR, not graph state&lt;br&gt;• No node calls a decision route (client does not expose them)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="760" width="700" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-c41" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Per-gate profile drives the subgraph&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;author tasks: G0 intake · G1 specify/checklist/clarify · G2 plan · G3 tasks/analyze/implement · G4 RAI suites · G5 CR, release record · G6/G7 reports&lt;br&gt;human inputs: G0 submit + classification · G1 answers + limits/KPIs · G3 labels + PR review · G5 CAB&lt;br&gt;checks + thresholds: from gate profile for the use case's risk tier&lt;br&gt;triggers: G0 on intake event · G6/G7 on schedule after hypercare / review window" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
          <mxGeometry x="760" y="760" width="760" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-c42" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Lessons from the 0.4.0 pilot built into the design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Checklist at G1 found 7 gaps → keep checklist + clarify as author tasks with human answers&lt;br&gt;• Plan found a misrouted scenario → rework back to G1 signers, not a silent fix&lt;br&gt;• PR merged before G3 was signed → adlc-gates required check in CI&lt;br&gt;• Deliberate G4 rejection → rework path is a first-class edge&lt;br&gt;• /speckit-analyze needs tasks.md → runs at G3, not G2&lt;br&gt;• Guard hook has false positives / gaps → enforcement lives in the engine, hook is defence in depth" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1540" y="760" width="820" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>